{"id":"103-16","year":103,"num":16,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/103/103_Q16.png","answer":"B","codes":["S-9-5"],"perf":["s-IV-14"],"book":"B5","chapter":"第2章 圓","topic":"弧長和","difficulty":"中",
 "solution":"OG=1、AG=2 → OA=3。AC=EG → OC+OE=(3−AC)+(1+EG)=4。兩弧皆 60°：弧長和=(60/360)×2π×(OC+OE)=(π/3)×4=4π/3。選 (B)。",
 "steps":["OC=OA−AC=3−AC；OE=OG+GE=1+GE","AC=EG → OC+OE=4（AC 消掉！）","弧長和=2π×4×(1/6)=4π/3"],
 "trap":"不必求出 AC 的值——兩半徑之和固定為 4。"},
{"id":"103-17","year":103,"num":17,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/103/103_Q17.png","answer":"C","codes":["A-8-5","A-8-3"],"perf":["a-IV-5"],"book":"B3","chapter":"第3章 因式分解","topic":"提公因式整併","difficulty":"難",
 "solution":"前兩項：(3x+2)[(−x⁶+3x⁵)+(−2x⁶+x⁵)]=(3x+2)(−3x⁶+4x⁵)=−(3x+2)(3x⁶−4x⁵)。加上 (x+1)(3x⁶−4x⁵)：(3x⁶−4x⁵)[−(3x+2)+(x+1)]=(3x⁶−4x⁵)(−2x−1)=−(3x⁶−4x⁵)(2x+1)。選 (C)。",
 "steps":["前兩項先提 (3x+2)","合併後變 −(3x+2)(3x⁶−4x⁵)","再提 (3x⁶−4x⁵)：係數 −(3x+2)+(x+1)=−2x−1"],
 "trap":"全程不展開，只做「提公因式」。"},
{"id":"103-18","year":103,"num":18,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/103/103_Q18.png","answer":"C","codes":["S-7-3","S-8-1"],"perf":["s-IV-2"],"book":"B4","chapter":"第3章 三角形的基本性質","topic":"中垂線＋角平分線求角","difficulty":"難",
