 "steps":["角平分線 → ∠ABC=2β","中垂線 → PB=PC → ∠PCB=∠PBC=β","∠ACB=24+β","2β+24+β+60=180 → β=32"]},
{"id":"103-19","year":103,"num":19,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/103/103_Q19.png","answer":"C","codes":["N-7-9","S-9-13"],"perf":["n-IV-4"],"book":"B2","chapter":"第3章 比與比例式","topic":"水量守恆與比例","difficulty":"中",
