 "steps":["水只在杯間移動 → 總量不變","設高度 3k、4k、5k 列體積和","1000k=2400 → 甲=7.2"]},
{"id":"103-20","year":103,"num":20,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/103/103_Q20.png","answer":"D","codes":["S-8-8"],"perf":["s-IV-2"],"book":"B4","chapter":"第3章 三角形的基本性質","topic":"大角對大邊（作弧）","difficulty":"難",
 "solution":"BD=BA、CE=CA。∠B=40°>∠C=36° → AC>AB（大角對大邊）。BE=BC−CE=BC−AC、CD=BC−BD=BC−AB → BE<CD。選 (D)。",
